          <p class="guide-disclaimer"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span> Apocalypse provides research and disciplined execution, not certainty. You control requested entries and ordinary closures. Broker-held stops and narrow emergency safeguards can close a position automatically when protection requires it.</p>
